  "description": "For a few years now, Merlin had been guiding young Arthur to become a Knight. One day, after dozens of dark incantations and mechanical engineering, Merlin locked himself in his cottage and performed a mystical and dark ritual to summon a fairy from another realm. His ritual succeeded and a young fairy named Morgana had appeared inside the cottage. He comforted the scared girl and made her feel at home. Time passed and Merlin introduced Morgana to Arthur as his adopted daughter. The two young ones grew up together and treated each other initially as siblings, though that changed as they got older. Merlin observed with a suspicious grin as the two grew fond of each other. It looked like he had brought the girl to this world for a nefarious purpose, but what could it be? He started pushing Morgana towards the dark side and as she started to change, Merlin was always watching from the shadows. Has there always been more to this man than the eye could see? One day, Morgana walked up to him and confronted him about his secrets. He grinned as Morgana used her cybernetic magic staff to imprison him in an interdimensional trap. After that moment, Morgana was convinced that she managed to erase Merlin from this world’s history and that his schemes had finally come to an end.",
